  /Type /Annot>>
  <</AP <</N 6 0 R>> /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK <</BG [] /I 7 0 R /TP 1>>
  /Rect [144.25 500 179.25 535] /Subtype /Widget /T (apple) /Type /Annot>>
  <</AA <</K <</JS (handle_input\(event\);) /S /JavaScript>>>> /AP
  <</N 8 0 R>> /DA (/Helv 14 Tf 0 0 0 rg) /FT /Tx /Ff 2 /MK
  <</BG [0.8 0.8 0.2]>> /MaxLen 0 /Rect [248.5 375 363.5 405] /Subtype
  /Widget /T (keyboard_input) /Type /Annot /V (Click here to play!)>>
  <</DA (/HeBo 20 Tf 1 1 1 rg) /FT /Tx /Ff 1 /MK <</BG []>> /MaxLen 160
  /Rect [85 759 145 789] /Subtype /Widget /T (score_field) /Type /Annot
  /V (0)>>
  <</AP <</N 9 0 R>> /FT /Tx /Ff 2 /MK <</BG [1 1 1]>> /MaxLen 160 /Rect
  [0 0 612 792] /Subtype /Widget /T (renderer) /Type /Annot /V <>>>]
